OL,3,GNEWSAPub used in cult classic film The
OL,4,AWicker Man up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pub in the south of Scotland where
OL,7,Fscenes for the 1973 horror film The
OL,8,FWicker Man were shot is going up for
OL,9,Fauction.
OL,11,FThe interior of the Ellangowan Hotel in
OL,12,FCreetown was the fictional Green Man in
OL,13,Fthe movie and had actress Britt Ekland
OL,14,Fas a barmaid.
OL,16,FIt has been closed for a number of
OL,17,Fyears and plans to convert it into
OL,18,Fshort-term let apartments were approved
OL,19,Flast year.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
